-chick-who-was-late-p9-s1","ord":0,"text":"That night the chick made a plan.","translation_ko":"그날 밤 병아리는 결심을 했어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-chick-who-was-late/audio/p9-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"That","charStart":0,"charEnd":4,"startMs":0,"endMs":380},{"word":"night","charStart":5,"charEnd":10,"startMs":380,"endMs":720},{"word":"the","charStart":11,"charEnd":14,"startMs":1040,"endMs":1400},{"word":"chick","charStart":15,"charEnd":20,"startMs":1400,"endMs":1440},{"word":"made","charStart":21,"charEnd":25,"startMs":1440,"endMs":1720},{"word":"a","charStart":26,"charEnd":27,"startMs":1720,"endMs":2120},{"word":"plan","charStart":28,"charEnd":32,"startMs":2120,"endMs":2140}]},{"id":"the-chick-who-was-late-p9-s2","ord":1,"text":"\"I will wake up on time tomorrow,\" he said.","translation_ko":"\"내일은 제때 일어날 거야.\" 병아리가 말했어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-chick-who-was-late/audio/p9-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"I","charStart":1,"charEnd":2,"startMs":0,"endMs":280},{"word":"will","charStart":3,"charEnd":7,"startMs":280,"endMs":560},{"word":"wake","charStart":8,"charEnd":12,"startMs":560,"endMs":800},{"word":"up","charStart":13,"charEnd":15,"startMs":800,"endMs":960},{"word":"on","charStart":16,"charEnd":18,"startMs":960,"endMs":1180},{"word":"time","charStart":19,"charEnd":23,"startMs":1180,"endMs":1500},{"word":"tomorrow","charStart":24,"charEnd":32,"startMs":1500,"endMs":2240},{"word":"he","charStart":35,"charEnd":37,"startMs":2240,"endMs":2420},{"word":"said","charStart":38,"charEnd":42,"startMs":2420,"endMs":2660}]}]}],"quiz":[{"question_ko":"병아리는 왜 친구들보다 늦게 풀밭에 도착했나요?","type":"mc","options":["길을 몰라서","늦잠을 자서","다리를 다쳐서","비가 와서"],"answerIndex":1,"explain_ko":"병아리는 해가 떴는데도 계속 자다가 늦게 일어났어요.","id":"the-chick-who-was-late-q1","ord":0},{"question_ko":"친구들이 병아리를 불렀을 때 병아리는 무엇을 하고 있었나요?","type":"mc","options":["밥을 먹고 있었어요","나무에 올라갔어요","잠을 자고 있었어요","집을 청소했어요"],"answerIndex":2,"explain_ko":"친구들이 불렀지만 병아리는 여전히 잠들어 있었어요.","id":"the-chick-who-was-late-q2","ord":1},{"question_ko":"병아리는 친구들을 어디에서 만났나요?","type":"mc","options":["강가에서","집 앞에서","큰 나무 옆에서","작은 연못에서"],"answerIndex":2,"explain_ko":"병아리는 커다란 나무 곁에서 친구들을 발견했어요.","id":"the-chick-who-was-late-q3","ord":2},{"question_ko":"오리는 병아리에게 뭐라고 말했나요?","type":"mc","options":["\"잘 잤어?\"","\"괜찮아?\"","\"함께 놀자!\"","\"너 늦었잖아!\""],"answerIndex":3,"explain_ko":"오리는 \"You are late!\"라고 말하며 병아리가 늦었다고 했어요.","id":"the-chick-who-was-late-q4","ord":3},{"question_ko":"그날 밤 병아리는 어떤 다짐을 했나요?","type":"mc","options":["더 일찍 자겠다고 했어요","내일은 제때 일어나겠다고 했어요","친구들과 더 많이 놀겠다고 했어요","풀밭에 혼자 가겠다고 했어요"],"answerIndex":1,"explain_ko":"병아리는 알람을 맞추고 내일은 시간에 맞춰 일어나겠다고 다짐했어요.","id":"the-chick-who-was-late-q5","ord":4}]}